rewritten-to-match
Same quicksort (middle pivot, Hoare-style partition, both halves recursed). Slices become index ranges (the language has none), and the per-run clone becomes a copy into a second array of the same size (the reference allocates a new Vec). Recursion stays within the 64-deep call limit for the run data. Other stores are checked and undo-logged. Scratch state rebuilt every run (the reference's locals: t) is declared `unlogged`, kept out of the undo log.
